{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3321","id":3886885694,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887nrSs-","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3321","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3321.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3321.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3321","number":3321,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"hscontrol: add libdns certificate challenges","user":{"login":"magndotcc","id":191621194,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2voSg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191621194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc","html_url":"https://github.com/magndotcc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magndotcc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What changed\n\nAdds provider-neutral support for `tailscale cert` and `tailscale serve --https` by advertising per-node `DNSConfig.CertDomains` and implementing the Noise `/machine/set-dns` endpoint. The endpoint validates that the authenticated node can only publish its own `_acme-challenge.<node>.<base_domain>` TXT record, then writes the TXT RRset through a registered `libdns.RecordSetter`.\n\nThe implementation does not run an authoritative DNS server and does not import any provider-specific DNS package in Headscale core. Concrete libdns providers register a factory with `RegisterDNSCertificateProvider`.\n\n## User impact\n\nOperators can enable `dns.certificates` to let clients obtain certificates for their MagicDNS names. Clients learn support is enabled through `DNSConfig.CertDomains`; without that signal, `tailscale cert` reports HTTPS certificate support as not configured.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Only TXT records are accepted.\n- Nodes can only update their own ACME challenge name.\n- Noise machine key and node key are validated before DNS updates.\n- Concurrent challenge values for the same name are preserved in the RRset.\n- Provider credentials in `provider_config` are omitted from JSON config output.\n\n## Docs\n\nAdds config example coverage, a Serve/certificate reference page, mkdocs navigation, feature matrix updates, and changelog entry.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `go test ./hscontrol ./hscontrol/mapper ./hscontrol/types`\n- `git diff --check`","created_at":"2026-06-17T21:27:05Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T21:27:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":f